kerFirefox rte--contrast-theme rte--fixH2Alignment"><p class=3D"noSpacingAb=
ove spacingBelow" data-text-type=3D"withSpacing"><strong>aIQuad @ Lakehouse=
 - </strong>We are thrilled to announce the launch of the aIQuad @ Lakehous=
e, an immersive space designed for you and our professionals. This space ha=
s been specifically curated to enhance knowledge, expand skillsets and boos=
t confidence in our AI suite of tools and solutions. The aIQuad will featur=
e a variety of resources and topics tailored to support our employees where=
ver they are on their AI journey, and Lakehouse is the ideal location to he=
lp accelerate our AI transformation. More information can be found on our <=
a href=3D"https://kpmgus.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/US-OI-BUS-Lakehouse/Sit=
eAssets/aIQuad_FAQ-Lakehouse-guests.pdf?csf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3DNKzNFg"=
 data-interception=3D"off" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">FA=
Q page</a>.</p><p><strong>The Library @ Lakehouse </strong>- The Library is=
 back! Located just outside Blend, this wellness initiative lets our visito=
rs browse and read books on important topics. Hard copies are for in-Lakeho=
use use only this time, but our new system ensures you can easily obtain yo=
ur own. Love a book? Scan the QR code onsite, fill out a form, and get a Bo=
okshelf Voucher. Redeem it for a physical copy, e-book, or Audible addition=
 via our Virtual Amazon Bookshelf. Learn more about the library by visiting=
 our <a href=3D"https://kpmgus.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/US-OI-BUS-Lakehou=
se/SiteAssets/The%20Library%20at%20Lakehouse%20FAQ_Participant_formatted.pd=
f?csf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3DRvPJQg" data-interception=3D"off" target=3D"_=
blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">FAQs</a>.</p><p><strong>The Recognition =
Spot @ Lakehouse -</strong> The Recognition Spot at Lakehouse is an extensi=
on of our on-line Celebrate Great Recognition Program. It is designed to al=
ign with our commitment to expressing appreciation for one another=E2=80=94=
not just for the big wins or standout moments, but for the everyday efforts=
 that often go unnoticed. The Recognition Spot includes a box filled with n=
ote cards, mindset cards, and stickers designed for participants to recogni=
ze and appreciate their peers. Through The Recognition Spot at Lakehouse, w=
e encourage professionals to acknowledge and celebrate the contributions of=
 the colleagues, professionals, clients, facilitators, and visitors they me=
et and connect with at Lakehouse. More information can be found on our <a h=
ref=3D"https://kpmgus.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/US-OI-BUS-Lakehouse/SiteAs=
sets/Participant%20FAQ_The%20Recognition%20Spot%20at%20Lakehouse_032825.pdf=
?csf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3DD6Tipw" data-interception=3D"off" target=3D"_b=
lank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">FAQ page</a>.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Artisti=
c Expressions Inclusion Showcase</strong> =E2=80=93 The <strong>Artistic Ex=
pressions Inclusion Showcase</strong> is a year-round initiative that celeb=
rates Heritage and Awareness Months through <strong>culinary storytelling</=
strong>. Each month, a unique cultural theme will define the narrative and =
inspire featured dishes across Lakehouse venues. These culinary experiences=
 bring traditions, flavors, and stories to life=E2=80=94fostering connectio=
n, cultural appreciation, and community engagement through the universal la=
nguage of food.</p><p class=3D"noSpacingAbove spacingBelow" data-text-type=
=3D"withSpacing"><strong>Ignition Project</strong> - We=E2=80=99re excited =
to share we are in the final stages of construction for our Ignition Innova=
tion Lab at Lakehouse. The Ignition Innovation Lab is designed to deliver i=
nnovative solutions to our clients and a dynamic, immersive experience to o=
ur professionals. Check back soon for more exciting information, once compl=
ete! For more information on this exciting expansion, visit our <a href=3D"=
https://kpmgus.sharepoint.com/sites/US-OI-BUS-Lakehouse/SitePages/Lakehouse=
%20Experience%20for%20ClIents.aspx?source=3Dhttps%3a//kpmgus.sharepoint.com=
/sites/US-OI-BUS-Lakehouse/SitePages/Forms/AllPages.aspx" data-interception=
=3D"off" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">Client Resource page=
</a></p><p class=3D"noSpacingAbove spacingBelow" data-text-type=3D"withSpac=
ing">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; =
&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp=
; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nb=
sp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br><strong>Lakehouse Sticker =
Series</strong> - Embark on a modern-day scavenger hunt with the Sticker Se=
ries at Lakehouse! This engaging initiative invites you to discover and col=
lect themed stickers that each tell a chapter of Lakehouse's unique story. =
Series 1 launches with four initial stickers highlighting points of interes=
t, followed by more for continuous exploration. Designed to celebrate and s=
how pride in Lakehouse long after your stay, this fun-filled program is ope=
n to everyone. Dive into the adventure and let each sticker reveal a piece =
of Lakehouse's playful and vibrant narrative. Learn more about this excitin=
g journey by visiting our <a href=3D"https://lakehouse.qualtrics.com/Contro=
lPanel/File.php?F=3DF_Q2ihBuyxtVxO0Cg" data-interception=3D"off" target=3D"=
_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">FAQs</a>.</p><p class=3D"noSpacingAbove=
 spacingBelow" data-text-type=3D"withSpacing"><strong>Enhanced Wifi, just f=
or Lakehouse</strong> - The Lakehouse Wi-Fi is being upgraded with enhancem=
ents and deliverables specifically tailored to the unique environment of th=
e Lakehouse. These improvements are designed to provide all professionals a=
nd guests with a streamlined and personalized experience, significantly boo=
sting satisfaction and comfort during their stay. This is a huge win for ou=
r Lakehouse experience!<br>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><d=
